on_dragview","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The card maps the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If its touch-up position is within"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch pulses Drag’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Reset input and returns the card to its origin."}]}}}